    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre E through O. It crosses line OE again at G. Draw a circle with centre G through O. It crosses the horizontal line at K1 and the vertical line at K2. Draw a circle with centre O through K1. It crosses the two lines again at K3 and K4.",
      "create": {
        "co": {"circle": {"centre": "E", "through": "O"}},
